{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早安，兰华小姐！”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2546", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，是你们啊……”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0452", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "由于安洁也赞成，隔天星期二我们起了个大早。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比平常提早到校，并且拜访了学园长。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你们这么早就到学校了啊。”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0453", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，幸好兰华小姐也在，安洁松了一口气……呼。”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2547", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“昨天下午也来了好几次，但是兰华小姐都不在。”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2548", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊抱歉抱歉，我有点忙。老实说我好久没回到这里了呢。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0454", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁有麻烦爱理同学传邮件给您～”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2549", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，我想说爱理的事情之后再问就好，所以都没看，啊哈哈。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0455", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样还能见上一面真是太好了……”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长以前曾说她“没什么时间”，看来接近年尾她又更忙了。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天早早放弃，隔天一早来突袭果然是正确决定。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为这样，让主人这两天都早起了。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2550", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“关于这个，我已经得到１０成了。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，其实安洁到现在还心跳得好快。”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2551", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么意思～？”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0456", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是秘密！换个说法的话就是我们之间的私事！”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2552", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好暧昧的说法喔♪两人之间的私事。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0457", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“禁禁禁禁禁止您再追问了！”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2553", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "几乎等于说出来了啊……", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过害羞没办法谈正事。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想到的点子无论如何都需要有学园长的许可。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不好意思，学园长。可以借我们一点时间吗？”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛……５分钟左右的话。”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0458", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长瞄向时钟，表情有一瞬间严肃。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来她今早也是很忙碌。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果没有刚才那些谈笑，就能再多一点时间了，抱歉喔。”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0459", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，是安洁说了多余的话！？”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2554", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "各种意义上，是。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“了解了。安洁，既然如此。”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，那就立刻切换状态，单刀直入地说了！”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2555", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁挺直背脊，直视着学园长开口说。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以配合休业式，做一个很大的圣诞蛋糕吗？”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2556", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长愣了一秒。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……什么意思？”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0460", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“具体来说，就是让安洁在休业式中分送蛋糕给全部的学生。”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这就是我昨天的提案。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁转头看我，露出灿烂的笑容。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个……安洁，现在非常幸福。和主人一起，每天都很幸福地生活着。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2557", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这些都是这所学校、以及学校里大家的功劳……”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2558", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁想要感谢报答大家，所以提出这个方法。”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2559", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请大家吃圣诞蛋糕啊。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0461", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然比圣诞节早了几天就是了。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是这种事，有个华丽的名目很重要嘛。”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“再加上慰劳同学们第二学期辛苦了，这三层意义，希望能让大家开心！”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2560", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“原来如此。”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0462", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长笑着把背靠在椅背上，一副“说得详细点”的感觉。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是学校的工作，而是你个人的意愿啊。”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0463", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2561", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……还有，如果做蛋糕的话，主人也能一起做。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2562", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁红着脸说。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，我会小心不要扯后腿的。”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“昨天早上感觉只是让您陪着安洁，感觉很不好意思。”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2563", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“蛋糕就可以一起做了呢！”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2564", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我会努力的……一起加油吧！”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是！”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2565", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是只有安洁或只有我，而是两个人一起的感谢。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然是安洁先注意到了能够这样……", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“两个人一起”的感谢对我们来说，或许是最重要的事情。", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我们是两个人一起幸福的。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且……全部的人一起吃蛋糕，我觉得也很有意义。”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然也可以一个人一个人分别表达感谢，不过……”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2566", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“能够分享同样的东西，感觉就更棒了！”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2567", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──因为我们理解到分享同样的感情有多么快乐。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们两个人低下头一起向学园长请求。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，拜托了学园长。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以许可这件事吗？”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2568", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔嗯……”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0464", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长微笑着长吁了一口气。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她弯下腰拿起皮包，在里面翻找着什么……", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接着她掏出钞票，放在桌子上。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……兰华小姐？”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2569", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次是我们愣住了。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不好意思，因为我有点忙，所以什么都没办法帮忙。”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0465", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说是补偿有点那个，不过材料费由我出吧，拿去。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0466", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学园长……”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果说你们是要感谢学校和大家的话，那我则是想感谢你们呢。”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0467", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长露齿一笑。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁，至今为止因为有你在，帮了我很多，我也很开心、很快乐喔。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0468", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而让这样的安洁‘幸福’的小新吾，我也谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0469", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“兰、兰、兰华小姐……”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "ag2570", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么……”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我许可了！”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0470", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长高声说。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“现在很幸福──就让学校里的大家看看吧！”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "rk0471", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢您！！”“谢谢您！！”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾／安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": "ag2571", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们又再次对学园长低头行礼。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
